述したるものやがて此家庭教育學なり、","xmin":2914.0,"ymin":899.0,"xmax":2965.0,"ymax":1452.0},{"id":24,"contenttext":"個の特立したる教育學たらしめんとして、","xmin":2928.0,"ymin":1460.0,"xmax":2975.0,"ymax":1987.0},{"id":25,"contenttext":"節を分つこと八更に之を二十九章八十九節に分ち宗庭","xmin":2893.0,"ymin":1460.0,"xmax":2947.0,"ymax":2144.0},{"id":26,"contenttext":"之を系統的","xmin":2921.0,"ymin":1995.0,"xmax":2961.0,"ymax":2145.0},{"id":27,"contenttext":"〓育の意義由來目的より始めて","xmin":2894.0,"ymin":726.0,"xmax":2942.0,"ymax":1129.0},{"id":28,"contenttext":"結婚右舷船舶股收出產哺乳子才决明消防管官情書免育山の任家の数","xmin":2861.0,"ymin":1151.0,"xmax":2928.0,"ymax":2143.0},{"id":29,"contenttext":"至るまで、","xmin":2880.0,"ymin":725.0,"xmax":2910.0,"ymax":856.0},{"id":30,"contenttext":"極めて微に入り細に亘りて詳述し學げられたる項目の數のろにても","xmin":2846.0,"ymin":869.0,"xmax":2909.0,"ymax":1752.0},{"id":31,"contenttext":"四百数十の多きに及び、","xmin":2840.0,"ymin":1770.0,"xmax":2881.0,"ymax":2075.0},{"id":32,"contenttext":"述論","xmin":2841.0,"ymin":2080.0,"xmax":2871.0,"ymax":2142.0},{"id":33,"contenttext":"なりす","xmin":2795.0,"ymin":717.0,"xmax":2890.0,"ymax":1465.0},{"id":34,"contenttext":"して、死に 。有者に一番衆の、","xmin":2780.0,"ymin":1462.0,"xmax":2867.0,"ymax":1936.0},{"id":35,"contenttext":"加ふるに口語調","xmin":2812.0,"ymin":1940.0,"xmax":2850.0,"ymax":2141.0},{"id":36,"contenttext":"評者は此書を一般家庭の珍として推奬する","xmin":2781.0,"ymin":1597.0,"xmax":2830.0,"ymax":2138.0},{"id":37,"contenttext":"に吝なるものにあらざるなり","xmin":2787.0,"ymin":726.0,"xmax":2828.0,"ymax":1100.0},{"id":38,"contenttext":"「東京日日新聞」評","xmin":2734.0,"ymin":657.0,"xmax":2799.0,"ymax":970.0},{"id":39,"contenttext":"兒童の成長後如何なる人物となるかは兒童の遺傳、","xmin":2737.0,"ymin":1000.0,"xmax":2793.0,"ymax":1643.0},{"id":40,"contenttext":"養如何に關係する所多し自ら一世に卓越せる額官を帶び高位にあるものと雖も其子にして","xmin":2697.0,"ymin":1000.0,"xmax":2763.0,"ymax":2138.0},{"id":41,"contenttext":"性癖、","xmin":2736.0,"ymin":1647.0,"xmax":2774.0,"ymax":1726.0},{"id":42,"contenttext":"境通等に基くと雖も亦家庭の教","xmin":2724.0,"ymin":1735.0,"xmax":2774.0,"ymax":2141.0},{"id":43,"contenttext":"廿二子思能なんなのいちょふとかしらんもの世界にしてるかりなに","xmin":2669.0,"ymin":720.0,"xmax":2747.0,"ymax":2137.0},{"id":44,"contenttext":"當間がくてる-新ななかするに對するとをしてもの影響の電池の","xmin":2639.0,"ymin":718.0,"xmax":2718.0,"ymax":2138.0},{"id":45,"contenttext":"的「尊心して法律を","xmin":2608.0,"ymin":715.0,"xmax":2690.0,"ymax":2137.0},{"id":46,"contenttext":"の","xmin":2578.0,"ymin":713.0,"xmax":2663.0,"ymax":2137.0},{"id":47,"contenttext":"人","xmin":2548.0,"ymin":715.0,"xmax":2631.0,"ymax":2135.0},{"id":48,"contenttext":"論す子を持つ父母たるもの","xmin":2553.0,"ymin":713.0,"xmax":2603.0,"ymax":1062.0},{"id":49,"contenttext":"一讀す","xmin":2555.0,"ymin":1088.0,"xmax":2587.0,"ymax":1173.0},{"id":50,"contenttext":"べき良書たり","xmin":2547.0,"ymin":1171.0,"xmax":2585.0,"ymax":1346.0},{"id":51,"contenttext":"布","xmin":2481.0,"ymin":1640.0,"xmax":2542.0,"ymax":1702.0},{"id":52,"contenttext":"製","xmin":2481.0,"ymin":1724.0,"xmax":2538.0,"ymax":1788.0},{"id":53,"contenttext":"全","xmin":2485.0,"ymin":1814.0,"xmax":2532.0,"ymax":1871.0},{"id":54,"contenttext":"一","xmin":2491.0,"ymin":1912.0,"xmax":2524.0,"ymax":1937.0},{"id":55,"contenttext":"册","xmin":2475.0,"ymin":1981.0,"xmax":2532.0,"ymax":2042.0},{"id":56,"contenttext":"最","xmin":2489.0,"ymin":708.0,"xmax":2542.0,"ymax":768.0},{"id":57,"contenttext":"科學的〓育學","xmin":2409.0,"ymin":773.0,"xmax":2553.0,"ymax":1570.0},{"id":58,"contenttext":"新","xmin":2440.0,"ymin":704.0,"xmax":2504.0,"ymax":773.0},{"id":59,"contenttext":"郵稅","xmin":2391.0,"ymin":1638.0,"xmax":2450.0,"ymax":1749.0},{"id":60,"contenttext":"定價金壹圓八拾錢","xmin":2428.0,"ymin":1643.0,"xmax":2496.0,"ymax":2038.0},{"id":61,"contenttext":"金","xmin":2389.0,"ymin":1757.0,"xmax":2442.0,"ymax":1823.0},{"id":62,"contenttext":"十","xmin":2389.0,"ymin":1832.0,"xmax":2438.0,"ymax":1893.0},{"id":63,"contenttext":"二","xmin":2387.0,"ymin":1900.0,"xmax":2432.0,"ymax":1966.0},{"id":64,"contenttext":"錢","xmin":2383.0,"ymin":1975.0,"xmax":2440.0,"ymax":2038.0},{"id":65,"contenttext":"著者〓量「 系統的西洋教育史」を公にせし人なり","xmin":2364.0,"ymin":930.0,"xmax":2420.0,"ymax":1562.0},{"id":66,"contenttext":"此の書は西洋に發達せる思想と教育とを〓","xmin":2356.0,"ymin":1585.0,"xmax":2400.0,"ymax":2126.0},{"id":67,"contenttext":"東京朝日新聞評","xmin":2363.0,"ymin":648.0,"xmax":2421.0,"ymax":921.0},{"id":68,"contenttext":"究し之を骨肉として","xmin":2349.0,"ymin":930.0,"xmax":2390.0,"ymax":1188.0},{"id":69,"contenttext":"更に東体線に日本國有の題題と〓育さん研究し之を精神として「六","xmin":2327.0,"ymin":1212.0,"xmax":2380.0,"ymax":2126.0},{"id":70,"contenttext":"的〓育學を組成せるものにて、","xmin":2323.0,"ymin":709.0,"xmax":2372.0,"ymax":1096.0},{"id":71,"contenttext":"體系の整然たると、","xmin":2318.0,"ymin":1104.0,"xmax":2358.0,"ymax":1346.0},{"id":72,"contenttext":"議論の穩健なるとは此の書の特色なり","xmin":2305.0,"ymin":1360.0,"xmax":2349.0,"ymax":1842.0},{"id":73,"contenttext":"哲學雜誌評","xmin":2282.0,"ymin":647.0,"xmax":2338.0,"ymax":847.0},{"id":74,"contenttext":"文學士田中義能氏は篤學の教育家にして","xmin":2271.0,"ymin":872.0,"xmax":2342.0,"ymax":1393.0},{"id":75,"contenttext":"は〓育學は純粹に學なりと","xmin":2265.0,"ymin":875.0,"xmax":2306.0,"ymax":1219.0},{"id":76,"contenttext":"い","xmin":2262.0,"ymin":1215.0,"xmax":2289.0,"ymax":1247.0},{"id":77,"contenttext":"27","xmin":2264.0,"ymin":1246.0,"xmax":2293.0,"ymax":1304.0},{"id":78,"contenttext":"歐洲人の教育學が歐洲國民的彩色の基になれる教育學てある樣","xmin":2239.0,"ymin":1323.0,"xmax":2294.0,"ymax":2124.0},{"id":79,"contenttext":"最も變當なる學說を持し且つ唱へて居る人である。","xmin":2273.0,"ymin":1411.0,"xmax":2320.0,"ymax":2052.0},{"id":80,"contenttext":"又氏","xmin":2271.0,"ymin":2059.0,"xmax":2307.0,"ymax":2126.0},{"id":81,"contenttext":"手、","xmin":2252.0,"ymin":675.0,"xmax":2287.0,"ymax":728.0},{"id":82,"contenttext":"本邦に於ける〓育學も","xmin":2242.0,"ymin":732.0,"xmax":2287.0,"ymax":1019.0},{"id":83,"contenttext":"只西洋輪入でなく、","xmin":2236.0,"ymin":1043.0,"xmax":2274.0,"ymax":1282.0},{"id":84,"contenttext":"其れに國民的精神を着色することを忘れてはならぬといふ意見を","xmin":2216.0,"ymin":1298.0,"xmax":2265.0,"ymax":2122.0},{"id":85,"contenttext":"持つて居る。","xmin":2224.0,"ymin":677.0,"xmax":2262.0,"ymax":839.0},{"id":86,"contenttext":"是等の意見を本として出來上つたものが則ち本著科學的教育學である。","xmin":2191.0,"ymin":844.0,"xmax":2254.0,"ymax":1738.0},{"id":87,"contenttext":"本書は注意の能く行屆いた、","xmin":2188.0,"ymin":1746.0,"xmax":2228.0,"ymax":2103.0},{"id":88,"contenttext":"諸方面の問題に普くふれて","xmin":2185.0,"ymin":673.0,"xmax":2235.0,"ymax":1019.0},{"id":89,"contenttext":"所謂まめに手際に出來て居る本である。","xmin":2166.0,"ymin":1036.0,"xmax":2221.0,"ymax":1540.0},{"id":90,"contenttext":"行文は最も流暢","xmin":2166.0,"ymin":1546.0,"xmax":2204.0,"ymax":1752.0},{"id":91,"contenttext":"思想は太だ穩健","xmin":2162.0,"ymin":1773.0,"xmax":2197.0,"ymax":1976.0},{"id":92,"contenttext":"洗練の文","xmin":2160.0,"ymin":1998.0,"xmax":2195.0,"ymax":2117.0},{"id":93,"contenttext":"字中に健全の常識が貫いて居るのは氏の特色である。","xmin":2145.0,"ymin":672.0,"xmax":2206.0,"ymax":1339.0},{"id":94,"contenttext":"體者は必ずや此に由つて數育學の智識を新にし、","xmin":2133.0,"ymin":1347.0,"xmax":2182.0,"ymax":1954.0},{"id":95,"contenttext":"且つ豐かな","xmin":2128.0,"ymin":1968.0,"xmax":2169.0,"ymax":2116.0},{"id":96,"contenttext":"らしむることあるを思ふ。","xmin":2133.0,"ymin":675.0,"xmax":2175.0,"ymax":998.0},{"id":97,"contenttext":"田神京東","xmin":2956.0,"ymin":2183.0,"xmax":3158.0,"ymax":2246.0},{"id":98,"contenttext":"會株","xmin":2808.0,"ymin":2159.0,"xmax":2895.0,"ymax":2208.0},{"id":99,"contenttext":"社式","xmin":2808.0,"ymin":2207.0,"xmax":2895.0,"ymax":2262.0},{"id":100,"contenttext":"同","xmin":2698.0,"ymin":2163.0,"xmax":2781.0,"ymax":2252.0},{"id":101,"contenttext":"文","xmin":2536.0,"ymin":2155.0,"xmax":2645.0,"ymax":2256.0},{"id":102,"contenttext":"館","xmin":2397.0,"ymin":2151.0,"xmax":2497.0,"ymax":2250.0},{"id":103,"contenttext":"町保神表","xmin":2152.0,"ymin":2153.0,"xmax":2356.0,"ymax":2221.0}]